<title>GERMANY: Linotype Hell suspended in Duesseldort.</title>
<headline>Linotype Hell suspended in Duesseldort.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in German printing group Linotype Hell AG have been suspended from trading on the Duesseldorf stock exchange, the exchange.</p>
<p>No reason was given for the suspension.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
